  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: NULL pointer dereference on held jobs\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-107888.patch: abort a held job whose\n       destination printer or class has gone away instead of dereferencing\n       a NULL printer in scheduler/job.c cupsdCheckJobs(); backport of\n       upstream commit c5fc041ca0a211f8e69854907be7b55f56955659\n     - CVE-2026-107888\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: double free in printer-class management\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-107886.patch: clear the class printers\n       pointer after freeing it in scheduler/ipp.c add_class(); backport of\n       upstream commit 13bc9d4f8d695403d54469cc3c8b675e34a7037f\n     - CVE-2026-107886\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: resource exhaustion via held Send-Document requests\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-107885.patch: bound the time an in-flight\n       Send-Document may delay the submission timeout to\n       MultipleOperationTimeout in scheduler/ipp.c, scheduler/job.c and\n       scheduler/job.h; backport of upstream commit\n       3bb26257e343d2da2bee12bcc1e7a9b283fe4bec\n     - CVE-2026-107885",
